node_modules
storybook-static
documentation.json
# Only the four token artefacts are committed. dist/tokens.css is the runtime
# API and `tokens:check` compares the committed copy against the DTCG source,
# which is what makes a hand-edit fail the build instead of surviving until the
# next rebuild. Everything else under dist/ is bundler and declaration output
# that changes on every build.
dist/*
!dist/tokens.css
!dist/tokens.scss
!dist/tokens.ts
!dist/tokens.flat.json
